WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
[Gentle ambient music]
A little sun. The story of a life, growing in light.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
Around pregnancy week 2: conception.
A golden spark approaches a single cell.

00:11.000 --> 00:17.000
Weeks 3–4: dividing cells and implantation.
A glowing cluster floats among golden particles.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.000
Weeks 5–8: the embryo grows.
A small, curved form appears inside a luminous sphere.

00:24.000 --> 00:31.000
Weeks 9–12: early fetal development.
A small fetus appears, with its limbs gently folded.

00:31.000 --> 00:38.000
Weeks 13–20: the second trimester.
The fetus grows and moves softly in the light.

00:38.000 --> 00:45.000
Weeks 21–28: growth and development continue.
A world of hope, held within.

00:45.000 --> 00:52.000
Weeks 29–36: the third trimester.
The fetus grows larger as warm rays brighten around it.

00:52.000 --> 00:59.000
Weeks 37–40: approaching birth.
Almost time to meet the sun.

00:59.000 --> 01:08.000
Birth: a new beginning. The baby is surrounded by sunlight.
A little life. A whole world of hope.
Like the sun, you bring a new day.
